mmended next steps for common data loss scenarios.\n- Add a machine-readable recovery configuration and state snapshot artifact to support automated or audited recovery workflows.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add extensive user-facing documentation describing the data recovery plan, execution outcomes, and quick start instructions for invoking recovery tools and procedures.",
