        "number": 28,
        "title": "Design data recovery implementation plan",
        "body": "Implement a data recovery plan for Cursor AI chat and unsaved code, including a local extraction script and consolidated backups, to mitigate data loss in remote environments.\n\nThe plan addresses the challenge of recovering Cursor-specific data (like AI chat history) when working in a remote/containerized environment, where Cursor's `workspaceStorage` is on the user's local machine and not directly accessible from the remote workspace. This necessitates a user-actionable script for local execution and a clear, step-by-step guide.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-bf670926-936c-4acf-9e84-74fbee13cf5b\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-bf670926-936c-4acf-9e84-74fbee13cf5b\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd a documented, executable plan for recovering Cursor AI chat history and unsaved conversation data in remote/containerized environments.\n\nNew Features:\n- Introduce a detailed data recovery implementation plan document covering Cursor chat, local history, backups, and recovery tasks.\n- Add a Cursor AI chat extraction Python script to scan local workspace storage databases and export recovered chats.\n- Check in consolidated conversation backup artifacts to serve as a canonical archive for prior chatbot conversations.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Define suggested automation and backup enhancements (chat export, periodic state backups, MongoDB auto-backup, recovery dashboard) to reduce future data loss risk.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document a step-by-step data recovery playbook, including feasibility assessment, prioritized tasks, risks, and quick command references.",
