        "number": 27,
        "title": "Design data recovery implementation plan",
        "body": "Create a comprehensive data recovery plan for lost Cursor session data, including scripts for chat extraction, to enable recovery and propose future prevention enhancements.\n\nThis PR designs an actionable plan to recover AI chat/context and unsaved code by leveraging Cursor's internal storage, local history, and system backups. It provides a structured, prioritized roadmap with concrete commands and scripts, making the recovery process actionable and transparent for the user.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e71600c7-f41d-40b3-9122-40ac2d56fd28\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-e71600c7-f41d-40b3-9122-40ac2d56fd28\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd a structured, multi-phase Cursor data recovery plan with supporting scripts and quick-start materials to guide recovery of lost chat and code.\n\nNew Features:\n- Introduce a Python script to extract AI chat history from Cursor workspace storage databases into structured JSON.\n- Add a shell helper script to orchestrate core recovery tasks such as chat extraction, temp file scanning, and git stash inspection automatically.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Define a detailed, phased data recovery implementation plan for Cursor sessions, including task prioritization, feasibility assessment, and proposed prevention measures.\n- Provide a machine-readable JSON representation of the recovery plan to enable automated tooling and integration.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document a comprehensive Cursor data recovery implementation plan covering phases, tasks, risks, and prevention enhancements.\n- Add a concise recovery plan summary and quick-start guide describing immediate commands and steps for end users.",
