        "number": 26,
        "title": "Design data recovery implementation plan",
        "body": "Implement a data recovery plan for lost Cursor session data, including a script to extract AI chat history, to provide an actionable roadmap for recovery and future prevention.\n\nThis PR delivers a comprehensive 5-phase data recovery plan (`RECOVERY_PLAN.md`) for Cursor sessions, focusing on AI chat context and unsaved code. It includes a Python script (`extract_cursor_chat.py`) to extract chat history from `state.vscdb` databases, a quick start guide (`RECOVERY_QUICK_START.md`), and machine-readable JSON versions of the plan. The plan also proposes several enhancements to improve future recovery success and agent capabilities.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-247a6c40-a298-4f5e-9834-940b62b5e9da\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-247a6c40-a298-4f5e-9834-940b62b5e9da\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd a structured implementation plan and supporting tooling for recovering lost Cursor session data, focusing on AI chat history and unsaved code.\n\nNew Features:\n- Introduce a Python utility to locate Cursor workspace storage databases and extract AI chat history into JSON for recovery and analysis.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Define a multi-phase, prioritized data recovery strategy covering chat, local history, git, and theoretical last-resort options, including proposed long-term resilience improvements.\n- Provide machine-readable JSON representations of the recovery plan for automation and integration.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add a detailed recovery plan document describing phases, tasks, risks, and recommended enhancements for Cursor data recovery.\n- Add a quick start guide summarizing the immediate recovery steps, generated files, and recovery likelihood by method.",
