        "number": 25,
        "title": "Develop lost file recovery prompt",
        "body": "Implements a comprehensive backup and lost files recovery system to ensure data protection and enable rapid recovery for the chatbot application.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-b11b0726-e462-4204-8a71-52b60f3cd78e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-b11b0726-e462-4204-8a71-52b60f3cd78e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce a production-ready backup and recovery framework for the BMC Uruguay chatbot, including core engines, automation, tests, and comprehensive documentation.\n\nNew Features:\n- Add a Python-based backup system for chatbot data with manifests, compression, verification, listing, restore, and cleanup capabilities.\n- Add a recovery engine that detects missing/corrupted files and supports multiple recovery strategies including backups, MongoDB, Git history, regeneration, and manual intervention.\n- Provide a shell-based automation script to orchestrate scheduled backups, verification, cleanup, and recovery routines with logging.\n- Add a test harness to validate backup and recovery flows end-to-end.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Document the backup and recovery design, quickstart usage, implementation details, and execution status in dedicated markdown guides and summaries.\n\nTests:\n- Introduce an automated test script that exercises backup creation, verification, listing, file restoration, missing/corrupted file detection, and backup cleanup.",
