        "number": 12,
        "title": "Optimize central language module analysis",
        "body": "Introduce a centralized language processing module to optimize text handling, improve performance, and enable multilingual support.\n\nThe existing language processing logic was fragmented across multiple files, leading to duplicated code, lack of language detection, no caching, and no conversation context. This PR consolidates these functionalities into a single, efficient module, significantly improving processing speed, maintainability, and expanding language capabilities.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-0d230880-17a6-4bab-b965-b0e6497c1356\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-0d230880-17a6-4bab-b965-b0e6497c1356\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce a centralized language processing module for multilingual intent detection and entity extraction, with caching and context management, plus developer documentation and integration examples.\n\nNew Features:\n- Add a central LanguageProcessor module providing language detection, text normalization, intent classification, entity extraction, caching, and context-aware processing for Spanish, English, and Portuguese.\n- Expose a global accessor for the language processor and statistics export for cache and context usage.\n- Provide integration helpers to enhance existing conversational agents using the new language module.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Document the language module architecture, capabilities, best practices, and migration strategy through multiple Markdown guides for developers.",
