        "number": 13,
        "title": "Optimize central language module analysis",
        "body": "Implement core optimizations for the central language module to enhance performance, reliability, and scalability.\n\nThis PR introduces new modules for caching, error handling, rate limiting, performance monitoring, and MongoDB integration, all consolidated into an `ia_conversacional_optimizada.py` module. These changes address critical limitations of the existing system, such as slow response times, system crashes due to unhandled errors, vulnerability to DoS attacks, and lack of data persistence, providing immediate stability and a foundation for future advanced NLP capabilities.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-43c62406-2099-4533-bb8c-7ec387a8a070\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-43c62406-2099-4533-bb8c-7ec387a8a070\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd comprehensive documentation and implementation guides for optimizing the central language module of the BMC Uruguay chatbot, including design analysis, comparison tables, and quick-start references.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Introduce an optimized IA module design and supporting infrastructure concepts (caching, persistence, monitoring, and rate limiting) as part of the documented architecture roadmap.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document a full technical analysis of the existing central language module, its limitations, and proposed optimizations.\n- Provide a step-by-step implementation guide for performance, reliability, and scalability improvements, including caching, error handling, rate limiting, monitoring, and MongoDB usage.\n- Add executive and quick-reference summaries outlining the optimization roadmap, ROI, and recommended phases of work.\n- Include comparison tables contrasting the current system with best practices and the proposed optimized architecture.\n- Document a delivery summary describing all artifacts, code modules, and expected business impact of the optimization work.",
