        "number": 10,
        "title": "Optimize central language module analysis",
        "body": "Introduce a central language module and i18n infrastructure to enable multi-language support and streamline content management.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-83b51128-e2de-4fb1-b022-6b277c7042bc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-83b51128-e2de-4fb1-b022-6b277c7042bc\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce a centralized Python language module and foundational translation assets to enable multi-language support and guide migration away from hardcoded Spanish content.\n\nNew Features:\n- Add a reusable Python LanguageManager module providing translation lookup, pluralization, formatting, language detection, and a global accessor for backend internationalization.\n- Introduce an initial locales directory structure with JSON namespace files for common, quotes, products, and AI responses to standardize translations across languages.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add an in-depth analysis document detailing current language handling, limitations, best-practice options, and a phased implementation plan for a central language module.\n- Add a before/after migration guide showing how to refactor existing backend and frontend code to use the new language module and translation keys instead of hardcoded strings.\n- Add a quick start guide covering setup, common usage patterns, integration examples, and troubleshooting for the new language module.\n- Add an implementation summary outlining deliverables, recommended hybrid i18n architecture, migration phases, and expected impact.",
