        "body": "Add a comprehensive analysis document for the central language module to detail its current status, capabilities, limitations, and optimization recommendations.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-b9dbd7cd-bf53-4bd2-83b3-d437489e0fd0\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-b9dbd7cd-bf53-4bd2-83b3-d437489e0fd0\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd a comprehensive analysis document describing the central language processing module for the BMC Uruguay quotation system, its current capabilities, limitations, and recommended optimizations.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document the current architecture, capabilities, and constraints of the central language module across frontend, backend, and utilities.\n- Outline gaps against industry best practices and propose prioritized optimization steps, including NLP, scalability, and integration improvements.\n- Provide testing, performance, and implementation roadmap guidance for evolving the language module.",
