      {
        "number": 9,
        "title": "Host chatbot with service",
        "body": "Refactor the chatbot into a deployable FastAPI service and add comprehensive hosting documentation and configurations.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-2e75adee-68ff-4bc8-a345-07951a811f2a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-2e75adee-68ff-4bc8-a345-07951a811f2a\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nConvert the monolithic interactive chatbot script into a deployable FastAPI web service with REST endpoints for chat, quotes, products, health, and WhatsApp webhooks, and add comprehensive multi-platform hosting and deployment documentation plus automation scripts and configs.\n\nNew Features:\n- Expose a production-ready FastAPI application that provides REST APIs for chat interactions, quote creation and retrieval, product catalog access, health checks, admin stats, and WhatsApp webhook handling.\n- Introduce a Bash deployment script that automates deploying the backend and frontend across Railway, Vercel, cPanel, and Render, including pre-flight checks and interactive flows.\n- Add detailed hosting guides and quick-start documentation covering full-cloud, hybrid cPanel, and alternative deployment setups, along with environment variable templates and indices for credentials and platform configuration.\n- Provide Render and Railway configuration files, a Procfile for process definition, and an example .env file to streamline multi-platform deployments.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Refactor the previous integrated CLI-style system entry point into an HTTP API server, adding CORS, structured request/response models, logging, startup/shutdown hooks, and custom error handlers.\n- Simplify integration with existing quotation and conversational AI modules by wrapping them behind clean API endpoints while maintaining backward compatibility via fallback behaviors when modules are missing.\n\nBuild:\n- Add Render and Railway deployment configuration files and a Procfile to standardize how the FastAPI service is built and started across platforms.\n- Introduce an example environment file to centralize configuration of OpenAI, MongoDB, WhatsApp, and frontend integration settings.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document complete hosting strategies, including cost comparisons, scaling guidance, security checklists, troubleshooting steps, and platform-specific deployment walkthroughs for Railway, Vercel, cPanel, and Render.\n- Add a start-here index and quick-start guides that orient users to deployment options, required credentials, and recommended paths for production versus hybrid hosting setups.\n\nChores:\n- Add a simple hosting index marker file to organize and reference the new hosting-related documentation.",
