        "body": "Add a comprehensive hosting guide for the chatbot, recommending Vercel + MongoDB Atlas due to current cPanel limitations.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-daaab14d-a2f3-46ac-b875-fc8334cd706e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-daaab14d-a2f3-46ac-b875-fc8334cd706e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nAdd a new hosting guide explaining how to deploy the chatbot using Vercel, MongoDB Atlas, and alternative VPS options instead of cPanel.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Document a step-by-step deployment process for the chatbot using Vercel and MongoDB Atlas, including environment variables and domain setup.\n- Describe an alternative VPS-based deployment with Docker and provide guidance for WhatsApp integration and common troubleshooting questions.",
