        "number": 6,
        "title": "Analyze repo and run chatbot",
        "body": "Introduces lazy initialization for the quote engine and environment variable fallback for credentials, alongside an `AUTOPILOT.md` runbook, to enhance system robustness and simplify setup.\n\n---\n<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-ca483c51-ea12-4dd9-a490-569e57ac75e6\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-cursor.svg\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents?id=bc-ca483c51-ea12-4dd9-a490-569e57ac75e6\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" src=\"https://cursor.com/open-in-web.svg\"></picture></a>\n\n## Summary by Sourcery\n\nIntroduce lazy initialization for the integrated quote engine and add runbooks and smoke test documentation to streamline setup and validation of the chatbot system.\n\nNew Features:\n- Add lazy, on-demand retrieval of the integrated quote engine within API handlers.\n\nEnhancements:\n- Update the integrated quote API route to initialize the quote engine per-request via a getter, improving robustness when the engine is not yet loaded.\n\nDocumentation:\n- Add AUTOPILOT.md runbook documenting end-to-end setup and execution of the chatbot stack.\n- Add SMOKE_PLAN.md describing cross-stack smoke tests for Node/Next.js and Python/FastAPI components.\n- Add n8n-review documentation mapping n8n workflows to in-repo handlers and fallbacks, clarifying integration behavior.\n\nTests:\n- Define a manual smoke test plan to validate critical chatbot, quoting, and integration flows across services.",
