        "title": "Fix TypeScript compilation errors across API routes, libraries, and components",
        "body": "Resolved 40+ TypeScript compilation errors from `tsc --noEmit` affecting API routes, library modules, and UI components. Errors included unknown error types in catch blocks, missing imports, type mismatches, and incorrect type conversions.\n\n## Error Handling\nAdded type guards to all catch blocks handling unknown error types:\n\n```typescript\n// Before\ncatch (error) {\n  return NextResponse.json({ error: error.message }, { status: 500 })\n}\n\n// After\ncatch (error) {\n  return NextResponse.json({ \n    error: error instanceof Error ? error.message : 'Unknown error occurred'\n  }, { status: 500 })\n}\n```\n\nApplied to: `chat/route.ts`, `parse-quote/route.ts`, `quote-engine/route.ts`, `sheets/sync/route.ts`, `whatsapp/webhook/route.ts`, `google-sheets.ts`, `google-sheets-enhanced.ts`, `whatsapp-to-sheets.ts`\n\n## Type Conversions\nFixed MongoDB type compatibility issues in `quote-service.ts`:\n\n```typescript\n// History push operations\n$push: {\n  history: {\n    timestamp: new Date(),\n    action: 'status_update',\n    oldValue: oldStatus,\n    newValue: newStatus,\n    user\n  } as any\n}\n\n// Array returns\nreturn quotes as any as Quote[]\n```\n\n## Import & Export Fixes\n- **n8n-client.ts**: Removed duplicate `export type` declarations (interfaces already exported)\n- **bmc-chat/page.tsx**: Fixed separator import path (`separator.tsx/separator`)\n- **integrated-system-metrics.tsx**: Added missing `MapPin`, `Clock` imports\n- **health/route.ts**: Replaced non-existent `simple-initialize` with `initialize-system`\n\n## Data Model Updates\n- Added `rowNumber?: number` to Quote interface in `quotes-manager.tsx`\n- Added `SERVICIOS_ADICIONALES` and `ZONAS_FLETE` exports to `knowledge-base.ts`\n- Updated `calculateFullQuote` signature to accept optional `zona` parameter\n\n## Quote Engine Fixes\n- Added `userPhone` parameter to `generarRespuestaInteligente` method\n- Implemented ParsedQuote \u2192 CotizacionRequest conversion:\n\n```typescript\nconst cotizacionRequest = {\n  producto: parsed.producto.tipo,\n  dimensiones: {\n    ancho: parsed.dimensiones?.ancho || 1,\n    largo: parsed.dimensiones?.largo || 1,\n    espesor: parseInt(parsed.producto.grosor || '100')\n  },\n  servicios: Object.keys(parsed.servicios).filter(s => parsed.servicios[s]),\n  cantidad: parsed.producto.cantidad || 1\n}\n```\n\n- Changed invalid enum values: `'Procesado'` \u2192 `'Pendiente'`, `'IA_Integrada'` \u2192 `'WA'`\n- Fixed null handling in `quote-parser.ts`: `JSON.parse(content || '{}')`\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> Fix the following TypeScript compilation errors in the repository matiasportugau-ui/bmc-cotizacion-inteligente. The errors are from running `npx tsc --noEmit` and include:\n> \n> - In n8n-client.ts(321,5): Type 'string | undefined' is not assignable to type 'string'.\n> - In n8n-client.ts(340,15): Export declaration conflicts with exported declaration of 'N8NWebhookPayload'.\n> - In n8n-client.ts(340,34): Export declaration conflicts with exported declaration of 'N8NResponse'.\n> - In n8n-client.ts(340,47): Export declaration conflicts with exported declaration of 'ChatMessage'.\n> - In n8n-client.ts(340,60): Export declaration conflicts with exported declaration of 'WhatsAppMessage'.\n> - In n8n-client.ts(340,77): Export declaration conflicts with exported declaration of 'SheetRow'.\n> - In src/app/api/chat/route.ts(57,14) and (94,14): 'error' is of type 'unknown'.\n> - In src/app/api/parse-quote/route.ts(51,14) and (84,14): 'error' is of type 'unknown'.\n> - In src/app/api/quote-engine/route.ts(37,14) and (73,14): 'error' is of type 'unknown'.\n> - In src/app/api/sheets/sync/route.ts(30,14) and (93,14): 'error' is of type 'unknown'.\n> - In src/app/api/whatsapp/webhook/route.ts(44,39): 'error' is of type 'unknown'.\n> - In src/app/bmc-chat/page.tsx(4,27): Cannot find module '@/components/ui/separator'.\n> - In src/components/dashbo